---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, telLink, mailLink } from '../data/site';

const effective = '23 October 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of use" description="The terms for using the Nexvhira website.">
  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="prose">
        <h1>Terms of use</h1>
        <p class="lede">Effective {effective}</p>

        <p>These terms cover your use of this website. By using it, you agree to them.</p>

        <h2>About this website</h2>
        <p>
          This website is run by {site.name}, a software company based in {site.city}, {site.region}. It describes our
          services and the software we have built.
        </p>

        <h2>Information, not an offer</h2>
        <p>
          The content on this website is general information. It is not a binding offer. Every project is agreed
          separately in a written quote, and that quote sets out the scope, price and timeline.
        </p>

        <h2>Product names and screenshots</h2>
        <p>
          Product names, logos and screenshots shown here belong to their owners, including our clients. They are
          shown to describe work we have done, and may not be copied or reused without permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>
          Some links open live apps and other websites that we do not control, including apps we built for clients.
          We are not responsible for their content or availability.
        </p>

        <h2>No guarantees</h2>
        <p>
          We try to keep this website accurate and available, but we provide it as it is, without guarantees. To the
          extent the law allows, we are not liable for any loss that comes from using it or relying on it.
        </p>

        <h2>Law and courts</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Any dispute goes to the courts in {site.city}.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms: <a href={mailLink}>{site.email}</a> or <a href={telLink}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose .lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
  }
  .prose h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
  }
</style>
